Package: com.iosvcam.opencam
Name: iOS-VCAM OpenCam
Version: 0.2.0
Architecture: iphoneos-arm64e
Description: Open-source, editable virtual camera + audio tweak. Video: pulls an RTMP stream on-device, decodes H264 via VideoToolbox, and overwrites mediaserverd's capture-graph frames in place (works in RootHide-patched apps). Front camera auto-mirrors. Audio: app-level TikTok-only replacement merged in (never hooks the stock Camera / mediaserverd audio, so it cannot cause the photo->video freeze). Fail-open with a /var/mobile/vc.disabled kill switch.
Maintainer: iOS-VCAM
Author: iOS-VCAM
Section: Tweaks
Depends: mobilesubstrate (>= 0.9.5000)
Conflicts: com.x.vcamera, com.iosvcam.audiobridge, com.iosvcam.audiobridge.system-hook, com.iosvcam.audiobridge.media-active, com.iosvcam.audiobridge.safe
Replaces: com.x.vcamera, com.iosvcam.audiobridge.safe
